.TH DANBY-CRICKETBOWL 1
.SH NAME
danby-cricketbowl \- spin and drag on a bowled cricket ball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/cricketbowl
.SH MODEL
The delivery begins at release height and combines gravity, quadratic drag,
aim, and spin-induced lateral Magnus force.  The side and plan projections make
vertical drop and sideways deviation separately visible.
